## 7. Team Features (Paid Tier)

### 7.1 Shared Task Ownership

- Tasks can be assigned between team members within a shared workspace
- Assignee sees the task in their personal IntentList — it appears as a normal task with a subtle "from [name]" tag
- Assigner sees status: Not started / In progress / Done / Flagged as blocked

### 7.2 Blocker Intelligence

- If 2+ team members have flagged the same shared task as blocked or high-friction, the workspace owner receives an insight:
  *"3 people have flagged '[task]' as blocked. This might be a dependency worth discussing as a team."*
- This is surfaced as a weekly insight, NOT a real-time alert — we do not want this to feel like surveillance

### 7.3 Team Reckoning (Paid)

- Monday morning team summary: completion rate for the previous week, top 3 unresolved items, and any shared blockers
- Framed as team health, not individual performance monitoring
- Manager cannot see individual mood states — ever. That data is 100% private to the individual user.

