## 10. Risks and Mitigations

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|---|
| Users dislike the 15-task cap | High | Medium | Make it configurable in settings (10/15/20) but default to 15; educate during onboarding |
| Mood-state input feels like friction | Medium | High | A/B test placement — try inline (above task list) vs. full-screen on open |
| Friction mapping feels invasive | Medium | High | Strict on-device-only policy; transparent explanation of what's being tracked in settings |
| Low Sunday Reckoning adoption | High | Low | It's optional; completion rate is not a primary metric; make it feel rewarding not obligatory |
| Calendar integration complexity delays Phase 3 | Medium | Medium | Build basic time-based intelligence first without calendar; add true calendar sync as enhancement |
| Team features don't convert free users | Medium | High | Do 20 customer development interviews with team leads before building any team features |

