## 12. Milestones and Timeline

### Phase 1 — MVP (Days 1–90)
- Week 1–2: Design system, component library, core task CRUD
- Week 3–4: Mood-state input flow and task-mood matching logic
- Week 5–6: Focused task view, swipe interactions, completion animations
- Week 7–8: Active task cap (15) + Cap Resolution Flow + Backlog
- Week 9–10: Onboarding flow (3 screens max) + beta user recruitment
- Week 11–12: Beta launch to 200 users, feedback loop, iteration

### Phase 2 — Intelligence Layer (Days 91–180)
- Week 13–15: Friction score system (on-device)
- Week 16–17: Friction intervention conversation flows
- Week 18–19: Sunday Reckoning
- Week 20–21: Sub-task generation from friction + person tagging
- Week 22–24: Public web beta launch + feedback iteration

### Phase 3 — Context + Mobile (Days 181–270)
- Week 25–27: Google Calendar integration
- Week 28–29: Location services + True Context Moment logic
- Week 30–31: Android native app (React Native → Play Store)
- Week 32–33: Team workspace (Paid Tier v1)
